      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "**PromQL (Prometheus meter `ArchLucid`, not Loki):** `histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(archlucid_llm_gen_ai_operation_duration_ms_bucket{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\",status=\"ok\"}[15m])) by (le))`\n\n**Metric:** `archlucid_llm_gen_ai_operation_duration_ms` from `ArchLucidInstrumentation.RecordLlmGenAiOperationDurationMilliseconds` (OpenTelemetry histogram exported via `Observability:Prometheus:Enabled` scrape of `/metrics`).\n\n**Labels on this histogram:** `gen_ai_operation_name` (`chat` | `embeddings`), `status` (`ok` | `error`). **No `tenant_id` or `llm_deployment`** on duration â€” use the **Completion tokens / s** panel for deployment breakdown.\n\n**Dashboard time:** default **24h**; rate window **15m** for stable p95 over a day.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0, "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(archlucid_llm_gen_ai_operation_duration_ms_bucket{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\",status=\"ok\"}[15m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "chat ok p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GenAI chat completion latency p95 (24h)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "**PromQL:** `histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(archlucid_llm_gen_ai_operation_duration_ms_bucket{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\"}[15m])) by (le, status))` â€” same histogram as the 24h panel; splits **ok** vs **error** chat completions.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0, "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(archlucid_llm_gen_ai_operation_duration_ms_bucket{gen_ai_operation_name=\"chat\"}[15m])) by (le, status))",
          "legendFormat": "chat {{status}} p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
